Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LINK (up|down|admin down|deleted)
Value PROTOCOL (up|down)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*?)

# One record per interface (campus-wan and vpn-fabric labs, IOS-XE 17). The Status
# column reports an administrative shutdown itself ("admin down").
Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Protocol\s+Description\s*$$ -> Interfaces
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized show interfaces description line"

Interfaces
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${LINK}\s+${PROTOCOL}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized interface row"
